      "description": "The inclusion of a dog and a pig in the image relies on the background knowledge that these are common domesticated animals often kept as pets or companions in human households. This knowledge is necessary to understand the meme's message that 'all animals are our friends' — it implies the speaker is referring to animals that are typically integrated into human society, not wild or exotic species.",
