      "label": "general public",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience without targeting any specific demographic or community. It uses universally relatable imagery (a child, common pets like a dog and a pig) and a positive, inclusive message ('all animals are our friends!') that appeals to people across different ages and backgrounds who value animal companionship and innocence. The child's gesture and the innocent tone are intended to resonate with anyone who appreciates wholesome, emotionally resonant content.",
